insert into public.posts (id, campaign_id, theme, position, body, linkedin_url, status, scheduled_at, posted_at)
values ('23c36c0c-f9cb-4b8f-953f-3c6645b33e6c', '002dc3bc-983b-4153-9759-6fd8e6200887', 'Most wellness apps don’t fail because of poor UX, but users ', 5, 'Most wellness apps don’t fail because of poor UX, but users lose emotional connection.

Consistency isn’t just a behavior - it’s an emotion. Here’s how behavioral design helps users stay engaged and supported:

1️⃣ Emotional Mapping - Align flows with how users feel, not just what they want to achieve.
2️⃣ Micro-Accomplishments - Build momentum through small, meaningful wins.
3️⃣ Gentle Nudges - Encourage action without guilt or pressure.

At CipherCross, we design wellness experiences that understand human rhythm - balancing science, security and empathy. Because staying consistent starts with feeling understood.

ð¡ Most users don’t quit - they disconnect.

